{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他感到一阵轻松的欢喜，能更自在地享受眼前的亲近。前面的相处已经真切地安顿过他，所以这一次的快乐多了几分从容。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他在亲近中体验到一种更从容自在的快乐。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前面确有亲近带来的安稳可作依据，但这种轻松与 S03、S04 已出现的满足和欢喜有一定重叠。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他在亲近里感到一点失落，像是心里仍有些重要的事很难被人懂得。因为他很少被真正理解，眼前的亲密也触动了这份旧需要。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他在亲近中仍会感到，被理解的需要没有完全着落。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这能承接他长期少有被理解的经历，但现有历史还不能证明眼前的亲密确实缺少理解。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc838ad7-4d49-4553-8f42-fa9f175e1837", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T020559954574Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.937, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:07:44.905778+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fead851176aeaa22cd118bbaeda7f7178f5ebfd2eb3d05f05432606494978cf3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_w